  <section class="training-section training-intro" aria-labelledby="training-intro-title">
    <div class="training-shell training-intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="training-eyebrow training-eyebrow--dark">Professional medical education</p>
        <h2 id="training-intro-title">Specialized Interventional Radiology Training Programmes</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="training-copy">
        <p>Bankers Vascular Centre provides specialized medical training opportunities for doctors interested in contemporary minimally invasive vascular interventions and image-guided procedures.</p>
        <p>Our programmes focus on two clinical areas:</p>
        <p><strong>Genicular Artery Embolization (GAE):</strong> A minimally invasive, image-guided intervention that may be considered for selected patients with knee osteoarthritis-related pain.</p>
        <p><strong>Varicose Veins Treatment:</strong> Contemporary management of venous disorders using appropriate minimally invasive approaches.</p>
        <p>The programmes aim to connect medical theory with practical clinical experience while emphasizing responsible patient selection, procedural understanding and patient safety. Participating doctors can explore structured learning, interact with experienced specialists and discuss the clinical considerations involved in these procedures.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="training-section training-section--aqua" aria-labelledby="training-why-title">
    <div class="training-shell">
      <div class="training-section-heading">
        <p class="training-eyebrow training-eyebrow--dark">Why train with us?</p>
        <h2 id="training-why-title">Why Choose Bankers Vascular Centre for Medical Training?</h2>
        <p>Build practical understanding through structured education, supervised clinical learning and discussions with experienced interventional radiologists.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="training-benefit-grid">
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h3>Experienced Medical Faculty</h3><p>Learn from Dr. Mohal Banker and Dr. Rozil Gandhi, interventional radiologists involved in specialized image-guided vascular and musculoskeletal interventions.</p></article>
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><h3>Structured Clinical Education</h3><p>Build your understanding through educational modules, clinical discussions and procedure-related learning.</p></article>
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><h3>Hands-On Learning Opportunities</h3><p>Explore practical learning experiences under appropriate supervision, subject to professional eligibility and clinical requirements.</p></article>
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">◌</span><h3>Live Case Exposure</h3><p>The GAE training programme includes exposure to more than 10 live training cases.</p></article>
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Personalized Training</h3><p>The Varicose Veins Training Programme includes personalized training opportunities and an online course option.</p></article>
        <article class="training-benefit-card"><span class="training-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><h3>Focus on Patient Safety</h3><p>Understand the importance of patient evaluation, appropriate clinical decision-making and procedural safety.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

